-- Zero subject default (ex48): the omitted left side is ゼロが, supplied by the host. Twin of 48-zero-subject.bqn.
-- Japanese surface: 小麦を生やす。 World layout remap: the .bqn row-store ⟨type,pos⟩ rows become columns type/x/y plus the wheat archetype bool. The cursor's raycast point 3‿4 enters as the registered spawn defaults for x and y (the bare spawn carries no at-clause and appends column defaults), and alias cursor is one-hot so the elided subject spawns exactly one row. The full-column x/y/wheat expects also pin the .bqn's prior-rows-untouched assertion.
--! registry 48-zero-subject
--! expect-n 4
--! expect wheat = 0 0 0 1
--! expect x = 0 5 2 3
--! expect y = 0 1 7 4

spawn Wheat
